  title: "15 · Stencil shader (Antichamber effect)"
  description: "Antichamber-style 'impossible box'. Each face is a quad with StencilMask (ColorMask 0, ZWrite Off, Queue Geometry-100) that writes its reference number into the stencil buffer. The objects inside use StencilObject (Comp Equal), so each one is only visible through the face with the same reference."
